<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Director General of the Corporation shall be the Registrar of Geographical Indications and have the control of the Geographical Indications Office."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
