<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_3__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Subject to the general direction and control of the Registrar and to such conditions or restrictions as may be imposed by the Registrar, a Deputy Registrar or an Assistant Registrar may exercise any power of the Registrar under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
