<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Central Geographical Indications Office and such number of branch offices of the Central Geographical Indications Office established under section 9 of the repealed Act shall be known as the Geographical Indications Office and branch offices, respectively."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
