<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_II__cl_5__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Any document required by this Act to be filed at the Geographical Indications Office may be filed at any branch office of the Geographical Indications Office and any reference in this Act to the submission at the Geographical Indications Office includes reference to the submission at a branch office."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
