<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_29__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any act which is required or authorized by this Act to be done by or to a person in connection with the application for the registration of a geographical indication, or any procedure relating to a registered geographical indication, may be done by or to a registered geographical indication agent duly authorized by the person in the manner as determined by the Registrar."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_29__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VIII__cl_29> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
