<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "The producer referred to in subsection (2) and any other interested persons may, within a period as determined by the Court, apply to the Court for leave to join any proceedings which may be heard by the Court to determine whether or not the registration of the geographical indication should be cancelled."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
