<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_VI__cl_23__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the registration of the geographical indication is cancelled by the Court on any ground under paragraph (1)(a) or (b), the geographical indication shall be deemed to never have been registered, but the cancellation shall not affect transactions past and closed."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
