<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_77__subsec_2__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "the use in the course of trade of a geographical indication by any means in the designation or presentation of any goods that indicates or suggests, in a manner which misleads the public as to the geographical origin of the goods, that the goods in question originate in a geographical area other than the true place of origin;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
