<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_77__subsec_2__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "any use in the course of trade of a geographical indication which constitutes an act of unfair competition within the meaning of Article 10bis of the Paris Convention for the Protection of Industrial Property of 20 March 1883, as revised or amended from time to time, as specified in the Schedule;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
