<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_78__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_78__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Any interested person of any goods identified by homonymous geographical indication may institute Court proceedings against any person for carrying out any act under section 77."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_78__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XII__cl_78> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
