<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_85__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar shall make available the Intellectual Property Official Journal to a person upon payment of the prescribed fee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
