<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_86__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar may provide a service for the electronic filing of any document required to be filed with the Registrar under this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
