<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_91__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Registrar may require the person to justify his request for reinstatement made under subsection (1) by providing any further information as the Registrar deems necessary."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
