<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_91__subsec_3> <https://schema.org/text> "If the Registrar allows the request for such reinstatement, the Registrar shall publish a notification in the Intellectual Property Official Journal that the application, right or thing has been reinstated. Mode of giving evidence"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
