<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XIV__cl_94__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A party to any proceedings before a Registrar who is desirous to obtain the costs or to have the costs taxed shall apply to the Registrar in the prescribed manner."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
