<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_69__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "A copy of every application to the Court relating to an application for the registration of a geographical indication or a registered geographical indication in the proceedings including an appeal from such application shall be served on the Registrar by the parties to the application in the manner as determined by the Registrar within the prescribed period together with payment of the prescribed fee."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_69__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_69> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
