<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_69__subsec_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_69> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
