<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_XI__cl_75__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "No person in the employment of the Corporation shall be required to attend court for the purpose of producing any document relating to an application of geographical indication or the registration of a geographical indication which may be obtained under the provisions of this Act."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
