<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_51> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
