<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_59> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_59> <https://schema.org/text> "No person shall, in any proceedings before any court in respect of any goods, document, material, article or thing seized under this Act, be entitled to the costs of such proceedings or to any damages or other relief unless such seizure was made without reasonable cause. Obstruction"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
