<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_62__subsec_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_62__subsec_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_62__subsec_1> <https://schema.org/text> "Where goods, documents, materials, articles or things which are the subject matter of an offence under this Act are found in two or more packages or receptacles of the same description, it shall be presumed until the contrary is proved that all the packages or receptacles contain goods, documents, materials, articles or things of the same nature, quantity and quality."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
