<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~part_X__chp_3__cl_65__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "All sums of money received by the Controller under this section shall be paid into and form part of the Federal Consolidated Fund. Principal liable for acts of servant or agent"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
