<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1> <https://schema.org/text> "[Paragraph 77(2)(b)] THE PARIS CONVENTION FOR THE PROTECTION OF INDUSTRIAL PROPERTY OF 20 MARCH 1883 Article 10bis [Unfair Competition] (1) The countries of the Union are bound to assure to nationals of such countries effective protection against unfair competition. (2) Any act of competition contrary to honest practices in industrial or commercial matters constitutes an act of unfair competition. (3) The following in particular shall be prohibited:"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "1" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1__para_1> <https://schema.org/text> "all acts of such a nature as to create confusion by any means whatever with the establishment, the goods, or the industrial or commercial activities, of a competitor;"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1__para_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@/~sched_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2021/16/eng@> .
